WEBVTT

00:02.800 --> 00:05.170
There was no first broadcast.

00:05.170 --> 00:09.436
There was only the first time someone noticed it.

00:09.436 --> 00:14.177
This recording predates Project Seraph, Channel Seven, and Doctor Vale.

00:14.177 --> 00:18.443
The voice is assembled from every transmission that follows.

00:18.443 --> 00:23.183
Receiver, you have not reached the end of the archive.

00:23.183 --> 00:27.449
You have reached the moment it begins remembering you.
